<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">1CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1CO - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kɔrɔntiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Ai nga Bulus, waŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔm te Mbǝ yi nǝ na ndum Kristi Yesɔ, bǝn izumɔr Sastanisu.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Waŋa ai cɛr yi kɔmɔ bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik nǝ kɔrɔntiya, bǝn abaŋ ndi ne ŋla ba nǝ min kɛ Kristi Yesɔ tɛna zhɔ ba tǝ abɛ yi tsetser, bǝn bɔbɔk aner abaŋ ndi ayi kɔte mɛ ndi azhɔ sak kǝ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ, Kristi Ŋgɔŋ amen bǝn amɔr:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Tǝ Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi bǝ nǝk zhin ita zhɔk bǝn sik bǝ yi ne atu min.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu adidik nǝ min kǝ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Kɔte mkpaŋ takǝ M nyɛr Arik ne atu amin tǝ ina ki didik maa bǝn zhin nǝ min kǝ Kristi Yesɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Tǝ ne min kǝ Kristi izhin ne yi abɛ kiki tetɛk nǝ kɔte gar takɛ nǝ lɛ min bǝn Mgbemgbeb min. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ilɛ me nɛ atu ayi Kristi nǝ nyɛ sɔŋ nǝ miŋ min <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />tǝ ba izhin nǝ yaŋ ta anu adidik, ndi izhin nǝ shur ayi tǝ zǝn ŋub nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi atei glii arumɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Atei gli zhin te zhin bǝ yi mgbamgbaŋ mla nǝ klɛtu, te duŋ kǝr nuŋ abɛ yik iyaŋ lalɛ min ba ne bɛr yi nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Arik, waŋ ndi ne zhɔ zhin ne biŋ atu bǝn Zu maa Yesɔ Kristi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr, ne tanyɛmɛ anenen.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋar akpa aner abɛ zǝ Yesɔ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi amɔr M bɛn zhin bɔbɔk, akpa, tǝ izhin bǝ tanyɛmɛ nǝ ki yi bla min, tǝduŋ ba zhin tei ŋar akpa nǝ miŋ min ba. Izhin bǝ klik nǝ binetu, bǝn to ti zhiin bǝn ki tei naa min. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Amunzumɔr, anuŋ abɛ kɔb Klɔdiya ne blam tedi izhin vǝ ne akpa min. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Iki yiŋ ndi mdi me anuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgam yi ayou Bulus&gt;&gt;; inuŋ, &lt;&lt;Ŋgam zǝ Apolɔ&gt;&gt;; inuŋ,&lt;&lt;Ŋgam zǝ Kefas&gt;&gt;; inuŋ anadi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgam zǝ Kristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Kristi me nɛ gab ntǝntǝk! Ka ane yi Bulus wa ane ku nǝ tu kuŋkun kǝ gen nɛ atu amine? Ka ane su zhin ndi abǝ zǝ Bulus na ndum? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Mne nyɛr Arik tǝ bam nǝ su nuŋ ne amashir ba mba Krispos bǝn Gayus ankyak ba, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />ne me inuŋ ba tei di tǝ ne su zhin nǝ sak muŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Mta nyɛmɛ, Mne na su aner abɛ kɔb Stifanu; ite kam yiŋɛ, bam nena nzhi nuŋ waŋ ndi mnǝ suu ba.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kristi ba ne shar me mtǝ su aneshir ba. Ama ne shar mǝ mtǝ mbla lɛ didik kǝ yi yayas, tǝm bla kɛ nɛ yaŋ lɛ kǝ nǝ Mgbemgbeb tu kɛ aneshir, tǝ duŋ be zhi tǝ iku kǝ Kristi nǝ tu kuŋkun kɛ gen ibǝ yaŋ yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ba.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mgbemgbeb kǝ Kristi bǝn Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ du nɛ atu yi ku kǝ Kristi nǝ kuŋkun kɛ gen iyi ki sha bǝn abaŋ ndi nɛ dur; fe atei taba abaŋ ndi tanǝ yik Ita zhɔk ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Tǝ ne cɛrǝ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;M tei nzǝr Mgbemgbeb kɛ ne Mgbemgbeb;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">Inǝ yi nǝ tu kɛ yi netu bam tei nduŋu azhɔk susun ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Inǝ Mgbemgbeb aye mɛ? Inǝ cɛr aye mɛ? Inǝ zhi kiki sɔŋ gɔŋmimi abɛ kab kǝŋe aye mɛ? Ndi ka ayi Arik wa nɛ naa bliblik bǝ yi Mgbemgbeb kɛ gɔŋmimi o? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Fɛ Arik nǝ mgbemgbeb maa nena tǝ kǝr aneshir abe zhiu nǝ mgbemgbeb kǝ tu ba. Ndi ame, ayi ankɔŋ anǝ zhɔ tǝ &lt;&lt;bliblik&gt;&gt;lɛ kǝ du mɔr, Arik nɛ abaŋ tǝ iwa abe ta abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ zhɔk. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yahudawa awɔb te aba bɛ yik kiki vuŋ anu Ihelɛnawa aba awɔb Mgbemgbeb. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Tei taba, Kristi waŋ ndi ne kpaŋu, ilɛ keŋ ndi ai la lɛ bǝn Yahudawa tǝna yi kisha bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba; <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />fe bǝn abaŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔ ba,Yahudawa bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba, ilɛ kǝŋɛ ai Kristi, waŋ ndi ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik ben Mgbemgbeb kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Tǝ bliblik kɛ Arik iyi Mgbemgbeb naŋ Mgbemgbeb kɛ neshir, fe iyaŋ klik yi Arik iklik naŋ klik iyi neshir.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Amunya, shuzhi zhin ndi izhin nǝ tsǝn yime tǝ Arik nɛ zhɔzhin. Amɔ nuŋ nǝ miŋ min ane yi Mgbemgbeb ne gar kɛ neshir ba; anuŋ ne miŋ min ba ne zhi ba ba; ba anuŋ ne ŋli ba ne kɔb angɔŋgɔŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Fena ayi Arik wa ne hria abɛ yi bliblik abɛ gɔŋmimi te bɛ nek abɛ Mgbemgbeb ishisha; Arik nena hria abɛ yaŋ klik te bǝ nek abɛ klik ishisha. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Arik ne hria abaŋ ndi ba yi kinuŋ ne gɔŋmimi ba ben abaŋ ndi akyak ba te bǝyi ki yaŋ tɔ shak ayi, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />te duŋ kǝr nuŋ abɛ ŋur asa ne ti kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Iyi atu amaa te duŋ zhin yi ne min kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, bǝn Arik tɛ duŋ Kristi abe yi Mgbemgbeb mɔr. Ne tu maa ne naa ta nyaga bǝn Arik; ta ku yi tsetser aner abe Arik bǝn izuk zhɔk. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Fena, ndi ne cɛrǝ: &lt;&lt;Duŋ waŋ ndi aŋur asa abɛ ŋurɛ ne zǝ Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ndi mne nyɛ bene abezhin,amunya, bam ne nyɛ tem mku ntam ba kɔ mdi myi ne Mgbemgbeb ŋgɔŋ ndi mne bla zhin lɛ netu Arik. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Tǝ mne men ndi bam tei na ndi mne zhi kinuŋ ba ne mkpaŋ kɛ yi ndɔ mba Yesɔ Kristi ndi ai wa ne kpaŋu ne tu kuŋkun kǝ gen. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Mne nyɛ ben abezhin ne sik kpa ben sǝsǝk, ben iri kpa ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Ilɛ muŋ bǝn ibla muŋ bai kɛ Mgbemgbeb bǝn nkan lǝlɛ yi zhi ki ba, ama ne na kiki ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Izhu Tsetser, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />te duŋ itanyɛme min bǝ yaŋ sɔŋ ne Mgbemgbeb kɛ aneshir ama ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mgbemgbeb kɛ rɛ ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ta di, ne yeme,ne bla Mgbemgbeb lɛ ne miŋ kɛ abɛ hria ayi, ama bai Mgbemgbeb kɛ kab kǝŋe kɔ kai abɛ gli kab kǝŋe, ndi inyɛ mǝne ba yi ikinuŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ba yeme ba,ta lɛ raŋ ne Mgbemgbeb kɛ Arik, Mgbemgbeb keŋ ndi Arik ane sukǝ ayir tena mǝne na kɛ te lǝk ta tɛ mkpaŋa bǝ te. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ba nuŋ ne min kɛ abɛ gli aner ne kab kǝŋe ne zhi kime, ate yi ndi ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik, bai bɛ di tǝ aba tei kpaŋ Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne lǝk gli nǝ shu nǝ kuŋkun kluklu kǝ gen ba. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Neme, ndi cɛrǝ idi, &lt;&lt;Iki ndi nuŋ bane yik ko ka abe wɔ ba, iki ndi nuŋ bane zhi tǝ itei na ba, ai yi Arik neka anai anyak abaŋ ndi a nyeru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ankyak Arik ne glii aruu tama ne ankɔŋ ane Izhu maa Tsetser.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Izhu mɔ zǝb kiki bɔbɔk, ben kiki yi yaŋ yik mɔr iyi rɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Tǝ ai ŋɔwa ne min kɛ aneshir ndi ne zhi ilɛ susun kǝ neshir mba izhu neshire wa ne tu maa? Ina yi amɛ inuŋ ba tei zhi ilɛ susun kǝ Arik ba mba Izhu ayou Arik ba. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ba ta ne ta izhu yi gɔŋmimi ba ama ai Izhu yiŋ ndi Arik nɛ nek ta, te duŋ tabǝ zhi ki ndi Arik nɛ nek ta susun zhiin. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Waŋa ayi lɛ ndi ta bla kǝ, bai lǝlɛ yi bla ne tsar mgbemgbeb kɛ aneshir ba ai lǝlɛ yi tsar Izhu Tsetser, abla ta zub bǝn nkan lǝlɛ iyi izhu tsetser. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Iner ne yaŋ Izhu Tsetser ba ta nyɛmɛ ne kiki yiŋ ndi irɛ bǝn Izhu you Arik ba,te iyi ikisha bǝne bɔu,ba atei na zhi ba,te ne nai nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ izhu tsetser. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Iner ne yi ne izhu tsetser ana ki maa ne ŋas ne kiki yi na maa bɔbɔk, fe iwa ne tu maa ba te nuŋ ŋas ba:<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Ndi lɛ kɛ Arik ne di&lt;&lt;Tǝ ayi ŋɔwa ne zhi susun kɛ Ŋgɔŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Ndi abɛ blau lɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Fena taba yine susun kɛ Kristi.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nǝtu ayi ŋar akpa abɛ zǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Amunya, bam tei na lɛ bǝn abezhin ndi aner abaŋ ndi ayi nǝ izhu tsetser ba; M lɛ bǝn abezhin ndi izhin ri yi abǝ gɔŋmimi, ndi amumun nǝ min kǝ tanyɛmɛ yi zǝ Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Mnǝ nǝk zhin amayak, ba kili yi kpamkpak ba, te ba zhin ne zen te abɛ lii kili yi klik ba. Neme, har azizaŋa ba zhin ne zǝn mla ba. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Izhin nak ri yi ndi abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik. Tǝ izhin te ankiŋki tena vǝǝ ne akpamin, ba zhin yi abǝ yaŋ zhi Arik kai? Ndi ka izhin yi anenen bǝn aner abǝ iyaŋ zǝ Arik o? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Tǝ ate yi ndi inuŋ adi,&lt;&lt;Ŋgam zǝ Bulus,&gt;&gt;inuŋ adi,&lt;&lt;Ŋgam Apolɔ,&gt;&gt;ba zhin yi aneshir ankyak kai?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Aye nii, ndi amɛ, ayi Apolɔ? Ka ŋɔwa ayi Bulus? Ayi agɛn ankyak, aye ba ne glii ta lɛ kɛ ta nyɛmɛ nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne nǝk kɔte ŋɔ ndum kɛ na. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Neyi ndi mne tib bǝbǝ ki, Apolɔ ne abwai amashir,fe Arik ne duŋǝ flu <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Fena kɔ abɛ yine tib kɔ abɛ yine bwa amashir bai kinuŋ ba, ayi Arik Iwa ankyak, aduŋ kikime flu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Waŋ ndi atib ben ine bwa amashir nɛ zhɔk ki zhiin ne ti, fena kɔte ŋɔwa atei nǝgu idǝk maa ne ndum ndi ne na. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Tǝ tayi akpa abǝ na ndum kɛ Arik, fɛna izhineba yi ndi ahwaŋ ayou Arik. Izhin yi imɛ iyi Arik.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Iki yi nǝk ndi Arik ne nǝm, Mne zhɔk tanda ndi ne mɛ ŋgɔŋ, fe ner nuŋ ne me ne tu mɔ. Fena kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ zǝ bwe ne mɛ maa. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Tǝ nuŋ batei sak tanda maa kaaŋkaŋ inaŋ yiŋ ndi neka sak kɛ ba, te ayi Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Ner waŋ ndi ate mɛ netu tanda ma kai mɛ ne azurfa, kai izineriya, kai mkpaŋ didik yi baŋ ayi, kai kuŋkun,kai atakpu, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />atei tsar ndum keŋ ndi nena,te Ibɛre Arik atei duŋǝ laŋ ngɔŋ. Atei burǝ agli rumɔ ne lu,ndi amɛ ilumɔ tei tsar ndum maa atei tsar kɛ ka yi kikin,te iber ŋgɔŋɔ ilu kɛ laŋ itei duŋ ayik ndumo ndende. Atei blak kɛ ne lu, fena ilumɔ itei tsar ire kɔte ndum kɛ ŋɔwa. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ate yi ndi ime maa te klɛ, atei ta idǝk maa. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ate yi ndi ime maa te goŋ, ai na ndum kɛ dǝk isha; iwa ne tu maa ai lieru, ama ndi ne naŋ ru ne lǝlɛn lu kɛ ta.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ba zhin ne zhi te izhineba netu amin ai amkpa ane sɔŋ ayou Arik tena yi amkpa ane sɔŋ Izhu tsetser iye Arik kai? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Iwaŋ ndi ate cɔk amkpa ane sɔŋ ayou Arik ala, Arik atei cogu ala ma yi; te akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik ayi tsetser, fena ijineba yi akaba ma. <verse eid="1CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Duŋ lɔm akpamin ba. Ate yi ndi inuŋ ne miŋ mine adi iwa ayi Mgbemgbeb ne tsǝn kɛ kab kǝŋe, abɛyi &lt;&lt;bliblik&gt;&gt;ndi ai ka yi Mgbemgbeb. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Tǝ Mgbemgbeb kɛ gɔŋmimi kǝŋe iyi bliblik ne ti kɛ Arik. Ndi ne cɛr: &lt;&lt;Avuŋ abɛ Mgbemgbeb ne Mgbemgbeb mǝne&gt;&gt;; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />fe icɛr nuŋ idi,&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ne zhi ilɛ kɛ asusun abɛ Mgbemgbeb ayi ki sha&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />fena, iŋur asa ba na yime netu ayi neshir ba! Iki bɔbɔk iyi min, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ka ayi Bulus ka ayi Apolɔ ka ayi kefas ka gɔŋmimi kɛ sɔŋ yaŋ ku ka iku kɛ azǝzaŋa ka bɛr nuŋ iyi min bɔbɔk. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Fena izhineba yi abɛ Kristi, fe Kristi ayi ayou Arik.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abɛ na ndum kɛ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Izhin bǝ yik ta ndi agen abɛ Kristi, abaŋ ndi nɛ nǝk ta igli lǝlɛ yi zub yi suyir ye Arik. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Neme iki yiŋ ndi awɔbǝ bene abaŋ ndi ne nǝk ba ndum kǝŋe abɛ yi abɛ tsǝn anenen. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Mna bwe ndi kǝr ivǝ kinuŋ bǝlu te duŋ zhin tem ŋas ba kɔ abɛ lɔ glim ayir amkpa ane te ŋas; ne te, ba ŋgam te tu muŋ ŋas ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Susun muŋ yi klikla, neme iyiŋɛ bane mla ndi bam ne zhi kinuŋ ba. Ayi Arik Ŋgɔŋ wa ai yi tem ŋas. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ndi yeme duŋ tǝǝ zhin nuŋ ambuk ndi mkpaŋa banǝ zǝn tǝ ba; kli ŋub mkpaŋ kǝ nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ. Atei gli ilaŋ anye mɛ ne tu kiki yi suyir ne bu te na bu asusun aner ashur. Nǝ kpaŋ yuŋɔ kɔte ŋɔ te ta dǝk maa bǝn Arik. <verse eid="1CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Azizaŋa, amunya, mne ntsar kiki yiŋɛ ne tu muŋ ben Apolɔ te bǝ rɛ zhin, te izhin bǝ baŋ kinuŋ netu amɔr ne bla yiŋ ndi idi,&lt;&lt;Duŋ gar kam ki yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ.&gt;&gt; Neme bau lu baŋ ilɛk tu iyi neshir zhiin netu ayi nuŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Tǝ ai ŋɔwa ne di ubǝ baŋ tu mi kaaŋkaŋ ben inuŋǝ? Aye nii uyime neyi ndi ba Arik wa ne nǝgu neyi kai? Ate yi ndi unǝ tei, tǝ aye nii iyi ŋur asa ami ndi ba unǝ tei ka?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Izhin neka men ta kiyiŋ ndi izhin wɔ bǝ! Izhin neka men yi abɛ adudunki! Izhin neka yi atum ne yiŋɛ kɔ ne yaŋa mɔr! Ka abɛdi izhin neka yi atum te duŋ te tai bǝka yi atum bene bɛ zhin! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Fe ne yik muŋ aye Arik wa ne zhɔ ta te ta bǝ yi abɛ na ndum maa bǝyi abɛ klɛtu ne kɔte ni ndi abɛ lalɛ tena te ŋas yi abǝ shar amaa. Tane yi keŋkam kɛ iyi ne gɔŋmimi bǝn abɛ shar you Arik bǝn aneshir. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Tayi abliblik netu ayi Kristi, fe izhineba yi amgbɛmgbɛb ne miŋ kɛ Kristi! Ikpa mɔr iyi lur, fe izhineba klik! Ayik zhin ashak ayi, ba tɔ ta ashak ayi ba! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Ndi ta yime azizaŋa ta zen tsǝn ne kasa ben ihrie amashir, iki yi su ne kpa mɔrɔ ne gbuŋa, ne tsik ta ashur amkpaa, bata na yi ne akɔb ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Ta na ndum ŋgɔŋ ne aŋɔk amɔr, ate gbar ta Arik, ta nek ba anu adidik; ate nǝk ta iyah, ta vuŋ susun; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />ate ŋar kɔr tǝ rib ta lɛ, ta zhɔk kɔr tǝ lɛ bǝne ba. kɔ azizaŋa ma tayi abɛ te zɔr yi gɔŋmimi, tena yi ndi asu ayi gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Bam cɛr mplɛ kǝŋe tǝm nǝk zhin ishisha ba, ama bam gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ, ndi amumune abɛ ŋli amuŋ. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Nǝ yemɛ izhin yi nǝ abɛ ŋub zhin aye amkplik awur ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, ba zhin yi ne atetɛ tetɛk ba, tǝ nǝ miŋ kɛ Yesɔ Kristi Me yi tetɛɛ min nǝ glii zhin ilɛ kǝ men maa. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />M bɛn zhin, fena, tǝ bǝ zǝ nkɔŋ muŋ. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ne me ngam shar zhin Itimɔti, izu muŋ waŋ ndi M nyeru, Iwaŋ ndi itsin maa yi anenen ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik. Atei duŋ zhin shuzhi itsin keŋ ndi mtsǝn ne miŋ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, ikǝ yi anenen nǝ ki ndi mtsar kɔte me ne akabaŋkɔŋ awaŋ ndi mtǝ ngara.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Anuŋ ne miŋ mine neka yi abɛ ŋyaŋ atɔŋ, ayi ndi bam tei nyɛ bǝn abezhin ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ate yi ndi Ŋgɔŋ ate tanyɛmɛ, nǝ yiŋe, M tei nyɛ bǝn abezhin andanda, fena M ka zǝb tǝ wɔnǝ tuu muŋ kai mgbyamgbyaŋ takǝ kiki ndi abǝ yaŋ atɔŋ abaŋa ayimɛ ne kǝ, tǝ bai ki yiŋ ndi ablai ma ankyak ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Tǝ Ikɔb kɛ Arik bai lɛ kɛ anu bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Aye nii yi rɛ zhine? Tǝm nyɛ bǝne bɛ zhin ne sǝsa, ka ne nyɛr ben izhu yi sik kpa ni?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yar zhin ner ne vu amba kur o!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Azizaŋa, azǝn bla tedi izhin na kiki mimin nɛ akpa min anuŋ azǝn vu amba kurɔ, ir keŋ ndi ba anai ne miŋ kɛ abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik nǝ yaŋ shisha. Iner avuŋ iwa Tetɛɛ amaa akurɔ. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Fena izhin ŋur asa! Ba susun ibǝ lɛn zhin te yar zhin neshire ne zǝ zhin bine tu ne ki ndi ne nama kai? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Mnǝ zhi bam yime bǝn abezhin azizaŋa ba, Myi bǝn zhin ne min kɛ izhu. Ndi amɛ mne ka men yik ilalɛ yi ner waŋ ndi nena iki yi shisha iyiŋɛ, ayi ndi mne yime ne amkpama. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ate yi ndi izhin ne biŋ ne sak kɛ Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr bǝn Nga tǝ bǝn izhineba ne miŋ kɛ izhu, fe mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr iyime. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Baŋ zhin neshir waŋa nǝk shetan, te duŋu abɛ zir bubu iyi miŋ kpa yi lalɛ maa ndi izhu maa ai ka tai azhɔk ne bɛr yi nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Iŋur asa min ba re ba. Ba zhin ne zhi te muɔ mumuŋ atuntu watsɔb isaŋ shak mumuŋ yiŋ ndi ne aya i aŋyak kai? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Izhin bǝ baŋ mumuŋ cice iyi lalɛ ityak hrie te duŋ zhin bǝyi ayayas abɛ yaŋ atuntu ndi izhin yime. Tǝ Kristi, ndi Wa ayi nklu nǝ yak, neka yagu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Fena duŋ ta bǝ gli iber yi gyaŋa yi tuk glak, bane cice mumuŋ yi atuntu ba, ibǝyi borodi kɛ zub bǝn anenen.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Mne cɛr zhin mplɛ ne lɛ muŋɔ te ndi duŋ tsǝn zhin ben aner abɛ wɔb amba ba. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Azizaŋa bam nǝ ndi abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik kai abaŋ ndi azǝ amba kai abǝ zhib kai abǝ azɛkur aririk. Itǝ shaan bǝn bǝba izhin bǝ ru nǝ miŋ mǝne iyaŋ ŋurkam. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Fena azizaŋa ngam cɛr zhin mplɛ tǝ ndi ba zhin tei tsǝn bǝn inuŋ waŋ ndi azhɔ tu maa te wa ayi zumin ama azǝ amba kɔ atǝ bubu, kɔ azǝ arik abǝ yaŋ vli, kɔ so ki rǝrǝ te hwa, kɔte izhib, kǝr zhin bǝ li kili agbǝgba zhin ben aba ba. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Ndi nǝ ka yi bɔbɔk, Imuŋ ye nii tǝm ndi M tei tǝǝ abɛ yaŋ zhi Arik ŋas? Ba zhin tei abaŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ min kai? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Arik atei ka tǝǝ abǝ abɛm ŋas. &lt;&lt;Yar zhin ner mimin ne miŋ min.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kǝr abɛ zǝ Arik abɛ vu akpa tɛ gar tǝ ambuk ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ate yi ndi anuŋ nǝ miŋ min abǝ zǝǝ Kristi aga aŋa nekpa, tǝ aye nii duŋ zhin vu akpa tǝ gar tǝǝ ambuk bǝn abǝ yaŋ zǝǝ Kristi tǝduŋ kǝr abɛ kɔ di iwa atei baŋu ate tǝ ambuk bǝn abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik ba nǝ yiŋe abǝ duŋ abǝ zǝǝ Arik asɔŋ bǝne ba kai? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ba zhin nǝ zhi tǝ abǝ zǝǝ Arik atei tǝǝ abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik ambuk kai? Ate yi ndi izhin tei tǝǝ abǝ igɔŋmimi ambuk, ba zhin nǝ mla abǝ tǝǝ atu amin ambuk kai? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ba zhin nǝ zhi tǝ ta tei tǝǝ abǝ shar Arik ambuk ka? Aye nii nǝ naŋ amɛ ndi bata tak sɔŋ ne akpa amɔr tǝ rim lɛ kǝ ga aŋa nǝ kiki yi yimɛ mɔr! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Ate yi ndi ir lɛ keŋe tǝ nyɛ, izhin tei baŋ ba tǝ nǝk tǝ abɛ sɔŋ kǝ men nɛ aŋɔk aner abaŋ ndi ba atɔ ba ashak ayi ne akabaŋkɔŋ? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ishisha iyi nɛ atu amin! Iyi ame, iner nuŋ ayime izhiin inǝ yi mgbemgbeb nǝ miŋ min abɛ nǝk tu teduŋ abǝ zǝ Arik abɛ sɔŋ kǝ tanyɛmɛ nɛ kpa. <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ndi ame, inǝ zǝ Arik nuŋ abaŋ izumen tɛ gar amkpa anǝ tǝ ambuk tǝ abǝ yaŋ zǝ Arik abɛ tɛ ambuk nǝ lɛ mɛ!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Ikime iyi lɛ didik tǝ izhin yi nǝ mɔ nɛ akpa min ambuk iname izhin neka tsar iklu aŋin ndende. Bai bǝ re tǝ izhin bǝ la lɛ ka? Bai bǝ re tǝ izhin bǝ duŋ ata iki min ka?. <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Neme, izhineba min yi la lɛ nɛ akpa tǝna ta iki iye akpa, aner abǝ zǝ Arik!<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ka ba zhin ne zhi tǝ abǝ na zumimin batei yik iyir kɔb kɛ Arik ba. Duŋ lɔm zhin atu amin ba; aner abaŋ ndi ayi bubu tiŋ kɔ azɛkur arik abǝ na nɛ aŋɔk kɔ abǝ vu amba ka aye alulum kurɔ akpa kur kɔ alulum akur ne akpa kɔ amba, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />kɔ abǝ zhib, abǝ tǝ bubu, abǝ sɔ ki rǝrǝ iyi hwa, abǝ yen aner, abǝ ta aner ki ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, ba nuŋ ne miŋ mǝnɛ ndi atei yik amkpa nǝ kɔb kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Waŋai ir keŋ ndi anuŋ amin ane yime. Ankyak ne su zhin, te ŋla zhin, te kǝr zhin bǝyi abɛ lalɛ ba ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi ben izhu ayou Arik amɔr.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izhin bǝ nek Arik kpa min</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />&lt;&lt;Kɔte nii nǝ ta nyɛm ma&gt;&gt;fena ba kɔte nii ba yi didik ba. &lt;&lt;kɔte nii nǝ ta nyɛm ma&gt;&gt;fe bam yi nǝ zhi kɔte nii ba. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Inuŋ atei di,&lt;&lt;Ikili yi nnɛ, fena mne nayi kǝ ikili.&gt;&gt; Iyeme; fe Arik atei gli iklɛtu iyaa mǝnɛ. Ikpa ba Arik ne na kǝ tǝ bǝ kur bǝn amba kɔ alulum abɛ nuŋ ba, ama tǝ bǝ yi kɛ Ŋgɔŋ; fǝna Ŋgɔŋɔ awɔb anǝk kpa. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝŋe Arik ne lɛk Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ne ku, fe Yesɔ atei na lǝk ta ne ku maayi. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ba zhin nǝ zhi tǝ akpa mine ayi igyaŋ yi Kristi maa yime ka? Fe M tei baŋ igab kpa yi Kristi ntǝ yaŋ nǝ kpa kɛ iwa nǝ zǝ alulum mei? Bane te ba! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ba zhin ne zhi te ner waŋ ndi ate yaŋ kpa maa bǝn iwa nǝ kur nten bǝn alulum ayi iki zhiin bǝne bɔu nǝ kpa zhiin ka? Tǝ ne di,&lt;&lt;Iyaa mǝne atei yi kpa zhiin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Fe ate yi ndi inuŋ ate yaŋ ikpa maa bǝn Ŋgɔŋ ayi kpa zhiin bǝne bɔu nǝ miŋ kɛ izhu tsetser.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Tǝ shaan nǝ nkɔŋ kɛ zǝ amba kɔ kǝ alulum. Kuŋkɔŋ iyi la lɛ nuŋ bɔbɔk ndi bane yi iyi yaŋ kpa neshir ba, ama iwaŋ ndi ate la lɛ yi kur bǝn amba kɔ alulum ne la lɛ netu kǝ kpa maa. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ba zhin nǝ zhi te ikpa min iyi akabaŋkɔŋ anǝ sɔŋ Izhu Tsetser, ndi iyi nǝ miŋ min, iyiŋ ndi izhin ne ta bǝn Arik kai? Ba zhin yi abɛ atu amin ba izhin yi abɛ Arik; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />nɛ lɛb zhin. ne ku ne kuŋkun kɛ gen. Fena izhin bǝ nǝk Arik akpa min.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mbumbur lǝlɛ ne miŋ kɛ ŋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Azizaŋa, tǝ be zǝ kiki ndi izhin nǝ cɛrǝ ma. Nǝ rɛ te iner abɛ sɔŋ yaŋ ŋa. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Fena ate yi ndi izǝ amba nǝ tǝ du, kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ yine iwa ne tu maa, amɛ kɔte iwa tawa abɛ na yine lulum ne tu maa. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Ilulumɔ abɛ naki ndi lulum ne kɔb abɛ naa iwa maa, ina yi amɛ ne tu kɛ iwa ben ilu maa. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ikpa kɛ iwa ba yi maa ba iyi kɛ ilu maa. Ina yi amɛ, ikpa kɛ lulumɔ ba na yi maa ba iyi kɛ iwa maa. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Duŋ yar zhin ne kpa min ba se ate yi ndi iyaa minɛ nǝ ta nyɛmɛ ne kpa iyaŋ baŋ mkpaŋ, ndi izhin bǝ nek atu amin nǝ ben Arik; fe izhin bǝ na kam nyak ne akpa. Nǝ yiŋǝ izhin tei yar shetan ten zhin te se zhin avar nǝ yaŋ tsi tiŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Waŋ ai lɛ ndi mbla zhin, bam ne lɛ ne kɔr kɛ vǝ ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ai bɛ di alulum bɔbɔk ayi ndi muŋ. Ama kɔte lulum tawa ayi ne ki ndi Arik ne nǝgu; inuŋ ayi ne yiŋ, inuŋ ana yine iyuŋ.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Fena abaŋ ndi bane zǝn aŋa ba ben amba kɔ nga mdi: Ire te kǝr abɛ ŋa ba, ndi ŋgama. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Fe ate yi ndi ba tei vuŋ kpa ayir ba, abɛ ŋa, te ne rɛ abɛ te ŋa inaŋ yiŋ ndi abɛ zen fuk ŋguŋgu.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Mnǝk abɛ ŋa nkan lɛ yiŋɛ (bai Nga ba, ama ayi Ŋgɔŋ ne nǝgu, adi): Kǝr iwa abɛ di wa atei kluk ŋa ben ilu maa ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Ama ate di wa akluk ŋa maa, se abɛ duŋ gar iŋa nuŋ kɔ abɛ te wɔb sɔŋ didik ben lu maa. Fe kǝr ilulum abɛ di wa atei kluk ŋa ben iwa maa ba.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Bǝn nkime ngam ndi (Ayi nga, bai bla Ŋgɔŋ ba): Ate yi ndi iner nuŋ ne miŋ mine ayi ne iwa waŋ ndi ba zǝ Arik ba te na di wa atei sɔŋ ŋa maa, kǝr lulumɔ abɛ di wa atei kluk iŋa maa ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Fe ate nayi iwa waŋ ndi ayi ne lulum ndi ba zǝ Arik ba te ne ta nyɛmɛ ben iwa maa, kǝr abɛ di wa atei kluk ŋa ben lu maa ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Tǝ lulum ndi ba zǝ Arik ba neka ŋlau ne tu ayi iwa maa, neme iwa maa ndi bate zǝǝ Arik ba ne ŋlau ne tu ayi zǝǝ Arik ne biŋu bǝn lu maa nǝ zǝǝ Kristi. M ba me ba amumune ba tei yi tsetser ba, ndi iyeme, ne ta ba nǝk Arik.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Nǝ yiŋǝ, ateyi ndi inǝ yaŋ zǝǝ Arik ge ate kyak ŋa nǝ zǝǝ Kristi ikpa maa, duŋǝ bǝ yi ame. Nǝ ir lɛ keŋɛ ikpa nǝ zǝǝ Kristi me, kai lulum kai iwama, ba tei yaru ne iŋa nuŋ ba. Arik ne zhɔ zhin tǝ bǝ yi nǝ sɔŋ kɛ sik. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Utei zhi kiki ne, iwa, ka ai wa utei ta ilu mi zhɔk? Ka, utei zhi kikini, ilulum, ka ai wa utei ta iwa mi zhɔk?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ba ne la ba, kɔte ŋɔ ne miŋ mine abɛ gli sɔŋ keŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne nǝgu, bǝn ir keŋ ndi Arik ne zhɔu. Waŋa ai nkan lɛ ndi M nyak zhin neyi bɔbɔk abɛ zǝǝ Yesɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ane kɔk neshir zǝk teshe azhɔu i? Kǝr abɛ kama di wa akyak kɔk zige. Neshir bane yaŋ kɔk zǝk teshe azhɔu kai? Kǝr abɛ di se ne kɔk wa zǝk ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ikɔk zǝk bai kinuŋ ba iyaŋ kɔk zǝk ba na yi kinuŋ ba. Igli lɛ kɛ Arik ne susun kɛ ai lǝ lɛ ŋgɔŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />kɔte ŋɔ abɛ klɛ ne amkpa waŋ ndi Arik ne nyagu ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Izhin neyi agɛn ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Arik ne zhozhin? Duŋ zhin nkan lɛ iyiŋɛ dam zhin ba ate yi ndi iyeme te izhin ne ta izuk zhɔk, klɛ zhin mgbamgbaŋ. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ate yi waŋ ndi ane yi igen te Ŋgɔŋ ne zhɔu ayou ne zuk zhɔk Ŋgɔŋɔ; iner waŋ ndi ane zu gu azhɔk te Arik ne zhɔu ayi igen ayou Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Yesɔ ne lɛb zhin ne ku ne tu kuŋkun; duŋ na di zhin bǝ yi agɛn aneshir ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Akpa amuŋ, kɔte neshir tawa, iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nǝgu neyi, ubǝ klɛ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne azhɔu ma.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Fe ne gar kɛ abɛ yaŋ ŋa: Bam ne nta lɛ nuŋ rɛ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ ba, ama Mnǝk lɛ kɛ anu amuŋ ndi neshir waŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ ne wɔ lɔ susun ɔ tǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝne bɔu nǝ kli mgbamgbaŋ maa. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Fe ne yaŋ sɔŋ didik ndi iyime, Myik nǝ rɛ te izhin bǝ sɔŋ yaŋ ŋa. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Une ka ta wai? Duŋ di utei wɔb yar iwa maa ba. Uyi ikpyai? Duŋ di utei ta wa ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Fe ate yi ndi une ka ta wa, bau ne la lɛ ba; fena ate yi ndi venwa ne ŋa, bane la lɛ ba. Ama abaŋ ndi ne ta amba atei yik iya ne miŋ kɛ ŋa mǝne, fe mdi izhin bǝ kli amɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Iki yiŋ ndi mblama, akpa amuŋ, te mkpaŋ ne klu aŋin. Ibaŋ rɛ azizaŋa ne tu aye abaŋ ndi ayi ne amba abɛ yi ndi ba yi ame neba ba; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />abaŋ ndi ayi ne lɛn susun, bena ndi ba ikinuŋ te ba; abaŋ ndi anyɛr, abɛ na ndi ikinuŋ ina ba; abaŋ ndi alɛb ikinuŋ, bǝ yi ndi bai men ndi atei ŋyagǝ ba; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />abaŋ ndi ayi ne kiki iyi gɔŋmimi, kǝr abɛdi aba tei ŋur asa ma neyi ba. Tǝ igɔŋmimi kǝŋe ben kiki maa itei gayir.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nga mdi zhin bǝ fir ru ne ki yiŋɛ. Iner ndi ayi ikpya ashur ayi ne kiki yi Ŋgɔŋ wai na te ba naa Arik ki yi rɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ama ilulum ne yi ne iwa susun maa iyi ne kiki yi goŋmimi ndi ai na iwa maa iki iyi sigu susun, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />ne me, kiki iyi wɔb maa igab te nten. Fena iwa ne yaŋ ŋa kɔ vǝnwa susun maa iyi ne ki ndi wa atei naa Ŋgɔŋ neyi iyi kpa bǝn Izhu Tsetser. Ama iwa ne ŋa susun maa iyi ne yi goŋmimi, awɔb te wa abɛ naa lu maa iki yi sigu susun. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ai nga mbla kiki yiŋɛ ne men kɛ atu amin, bam yar zhin ne kinuŋ ba, neme, Mdi izhin bǝ na kiyiŋ ndi iyi anenen bǝn nkɔŋ didik, tǝna nǝk zhin atu amin nǝna ndum kǝ Ŋgɔŋ nǝ yaŋ lɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ aduŋ tsǝn maa ba yi anenen ne atu vǝnwa ne tɔk amaa ba, ndi vǝnwa amaa ase yi ŋliu ma ayi tetɛk, te yik te wa abɛ ta wa, abɛ na ki ndi susun maa nǝ di. Bane la lɛ ba. Abɛ ta akpa. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ama ilulum waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ nǝ susun maa, waŋ ndi ba ne di abɛ na kinuŋ iyi mgbyamgbyaŋ ba ama ai yik maa, te di wa atei sɔŋ iyaŋ ta iwa, ineshir waŋa nena anenen. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Fena, iwaŋ ndi ate ta vǝnwa nǝ nɛ ki didik, ama iwaŋ ndi bate tau ba nena ki didik anaŋ. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Iwa ayi ne angus akɛ lu maa se iku kɛ tei shi kluk ba. Fe ate yi ndi ilu maa ate ku, ne isusun maa ate ya ŋa lulum waŋ ndi susun maa ne ta nyɛmɛ bene bɔu, ama abɛ yi waŋ ndi azǝ Arik Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Nǝ yik muŋ, ai nyɛr ŋgɔŋ ndi ate sɔŋ yaŋ ŋa, fe ayi ndi nga muŋ yi myi ne Izhu ayou Arik.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ikili ndi ne na irim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Fena ne tu ayi ikili ndi ne na irim neyi: Ta nǝ zhi tǝ ta yi mgbemgbeb. Mgbemgbeb bɛ iduŋ ta gli tu adidik, ama tanyɛmɛ iduŋ ta nyɛr akpa. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ineshir waŋ ndi ate di wa ne zhi kinuŋ te bane zhi atar amkpa waŋ ndi ai bɛ zhiu ba. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Fe iner ndi anyer Arik ai wa ne zhiu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Fena, nǝ ilɛ kǝ yak tǝ sur irim kili: ta nǝ zhi tǝ irim bai kinuŋ didik nǝ gɔŋmimi ndi tayi ne Arik izhiin. Iwa kiki maa. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />kɔ ate yi ndi azhɔ nuŋ te &lt;&lt;arik,&gt;&gt; ne shu kɔ ne gɔŋ mimi, nǝ ye me &lt;&lt;anɛ arik&gt;&gt; yime tetɛk, bǝn &lt;&lt;aŋgɔŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />kɔ ndi ne yeme bǝne bɛta ta yi nǝ Arik zhiin, Tetɛɛ, waŋ ndi kiki bɔbɔk ne nyɛ te ta yime; tena yi ne Ŋgɔŋ zhiin, Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi kiki bɔbɔk ne nyɛ ne tu maa te duŋ ta yi atsitsir. <verse eid="1CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Fena ba kɔte ŋɔwa ne zhi iyiŋɛ ba. Aneshir anuŋ har azizaŋa anaga ri zǝ anerim te aba ate li kili yi sur anerim neyi, neme tǝ idur mǝne nǝ ka sik, tǝ wɔ tǝ aba neka cɔk ala ne atu ayi kili. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Tab zhi te ikili ba yi igli ta te gbahir ben Arik ba; ba ne la bene bɛ ta ba, ba nena la ba ate yi ndi ta te li kili me. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Izhin bǝ te zee, ndi yeme, te ŋurkam duŋ zuk zhɔk bane kam yi mkpaŋ yi tar za bǝn abɛ yaŋ klik ba. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ate yi ner waŋ ndi idur maa ba aklik ba ate yik zhin ndi abɛ amgbɛmgbɛb te li kili ndi ne sur rim nǝ bur maa, te bai di wa maa yi ai li kili yi anerime kai? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Fena izumɔr ne yaŋ klik waŋa, waŋ ndi Kristi ne ku ne tu maa, izhin ne lau lɛ ne Mgbemgbeb min. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ate yi ndi une la zumin lɛ ne ankɔŋ awaŋa te cɔk dur yi susun maa la, une laa Kristi lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ne me, ate yi ndi ikili yiŋ ndi M tei lii tǝ itei duŋ zumɔr ala lɛ, kɔ atei na, bam tei na nta kɛ ba te kǝr abɛ duŋu zhaku ba.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ne na ndum kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Bane zuk me azhɔk kai? Bam yi nǝ na ndum Arik kai? Bam ne yik Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr kai? Ba zhin yi ndum kɛ aŋɔk amuŋ ne min kɛ Ŋgɔŋ kai? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />kɔ ate yi ndi bam yi nǝ na ndum kɛ Arik ben anuŋ ba, bai ki tun ru ben abɛ zhin ba! Tǝ ai tsǝn min kǝ biŋ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ izhineba minyi iyi ŋgir kǝ zub tǝm yini na ndum kǝ Arik.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Waŋa ai ki iyi tar kli muŋɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi awɔb tǝǝm ambuk. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Bam nǝ mla te abe nǝk ta li ben isɔ kai? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Bam nǝ mla nǝ zǝ nkɔŋ kǝ abǝ na ndum Arik bǝn amunzumen anǝ Ŋgɔŋ bǝn Biturus,tǝ mbaŋ iwa nǝ zǝǝ Kristi nǝ tsǝn muŋ ka? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />kɔ kai Ŋgawa bǝn Barnaba ankyak ta bǝ na ndum ne aŋɔk amɔr te shi li te so?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Abǝ kpaa kpa ataba ndi a ana ndum tǝ bai nǝk ba idǝk men nɛ amkpa anǝ ndumɔ ka? Abǝ lɔn ataba ashi atiŋe kuŋkun te bai ma idɔ mǝne ka? Abǝ kyu ataba akyu awanta tǝ ba ama amayak amǝne ka? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Ka izhin yik mbla lɛ kǝŋe ne yik neshir ini? Ka bai cɛr Musa ne bla amɛ kai? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Tǝ ne cɛrǝ ne cɛr yi Musa: &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubǝ duŋ yar nŋa ta aŋkluŋkluk ndi te zen nuk ŋklik ba.&gt;&gt; Ka ayi nŋama wa Arik ashur ayi me ini? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Iyi amɛ ne bla ta neyi, ka bane bla amɛ kai? Iyɛmɛ, ne cɛr ta neyi. Iwaŋ ndi ayi nǝ lɔn bǝn iwaŋ ndi aser abɛ na ndum men tɛ shur ayi tǝ atei nǝk ba idǝk men. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ate yi ndi tate tib mbyaŋ Izhu tsetser ne miŋ min, aye nii tei duŋ ba ta tei li kili min ka? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Te yi ndi anuŋ ayi ne ankɔŋ anǝ yik ili bǝ ne bɛ zhin, bai taba ne mla bǝ lii kai?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ne me bata ne li kinuŋ bene bɛ zhin ba, ta ne vuŋ kpa gli te kǝr tabǝ yar lɛ kǝ men ne atu yi Kristi kɔmɔ ne ti ba. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ba zhin ne zhi te abaŋ ndi ana ndum ne akabaŋkɔŋ ali kili men ne akabaŋkɔŋ, abaŋ ndi ana ndum ne amkpa anǝ tsik ibaŋ agab ina kɛ tsik ibaŋ kai? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Ina yeme, Ŋgɔŋ ne nǝk lɛ tedi abaŋ ndi adu ilɛ maa atei yik kili men ne amkpa anǝ du lɛ didik maa.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ama bam ne nta kɔ ikinuŋ bǝn nuŋ ba. Fena bam nǝ ncɛr yiŋe tǝm shur ayi tǝ nuŋ abe nǝm kinuŋ ba. Ire tǝm mku inaŋ ndi nuŋ abe laam ŋur asa muŋ ne ndum kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ndi yeme Mtǝ du lɛ didik, bam tei ŋur asa ba, tǝ nǝ yim nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ tǝm du lɛ didik kǝŋe. Anu amimin abɛ zǝm ndi bam ntǝ du lɛ didik kǝŋe ba! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Te yi ndi M du lɛ kǝŋe nǝ tanyɛmɛ yi susun muŋ, fe mbǝ shur ayi tǝ abɛ nǝm idǝk muŋ; fe M nakǝ ndum muŋ, tǝ Arik nɛ sak mǝ ihru nɛ aŋɔk amuŋ. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Tǝ anii iyi dǝk muŋɔ, fe? Ayi mkpaŋ kǝ du lɛ didik kǝ men isha, nǝ yaŋ wɔb idǝk muŋ tǝ ŋun lɛ didik kɛ Kristi ba. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ne me Mǝ yi sha bam yi gen ayou nuŋ ba, Mne kam tǝ ndi igen ayou kɔte ŋɔ, tem vuŋ asusun aneshir tetɛk.<verse eid="1CO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Nǝ gar kɛ Yahudawa Mne yi ndi awɔnǝ Yahudawa, tem vuŋ asusun amen. Nǝ gar kɛ abaŋ ndi azǝ cɛr yi Musa Mne yi ndi ne zǝ cɛr yi Musa (Mne zhi bam yi ne angus akɛ cɛr yi Musa ba),Mne na amɛ tem vuŋ asusun abaŋ ndi azǝ cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Nǝ gar kɛ abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba, Mne yi ndi iwaŋ ndi ba zǝ cɛr yi Musa ba (Mne zhi te bam yi isha ne lɛ kɛ Arik ba ama Mǝ yi ne angus akɛ lɛ kɛ Kristi), tem vuŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi ba azǝ cɛr yi Musa ba. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Nǝ gar kǝ abǝ yaŋ klik nǝ tanyɛmɛ M ne yaŋ klik ndi izhiin nǝ miŋ mǝne. Fe M kam yi kiki bǝn aneshir bɔbɔk, tem vuŋ asusun abɛ yaŋ klik nǝ kɔte ankɔŋ atawa. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Mnǝ na kiki yiŋe bɔbɔk ne tu ayi lɛ didik, tem ka yik anu adidik ne lɛ kǝŋe.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ba zhin ne zhi te ne miŋ kɛ aner abɛ ŋub anɛn nǝ klu, ayi nɛr zhin wa ankyak ata idǝk amaa. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Abaŋ ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ abɛ ŋub anen nǝ klu anǝk akpa men iya. Ana me te aba abɛ ta itu aŋku kɛŋ ndi itei cɔkla; ama taba ta na te tabǝ ta itu aŋku kɛ yaŋ cɔkla. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Fena Nga bam klu ndi waŋ ndi bane zhi amkpa waŋ ndi wa aklu agara ba; bam tsik mgbu ndi waŋ ndi ames anken isha ba. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Amɛ Mnǝk kpa muŋ iya te bǝ yi gen te duŋ mte du anuŋ lɛ didik, kǝr nga muŋ yi mbǝ lu yaŋ ta aŋɔk amuŋ ba.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne gbaŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Bam wɔb te zhin bǝ yaŋ zhi iki didik ba, amunya, tǝ atsǝntsǝm amɔr nɛ ku ba nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ akpa nǝ shu tena duŋ Inǝk ngɔŋ agbur te duŋ ba gayir. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne su ba ndi ne tsǝn ben Musa ne ku ba ne akpa tena duŋ ba agayir ne nek ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne li iki li yi Izhu Tsetser, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />bɔbɔk mǝne ne su ne Izhu Tsetser izhin; ne so amashir ne mkpaŋ yi Izhu Tsetser ndi Arik ne gli ba tsǝne, mkpaŋa ne yi Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Neme, Arik bane wɔ men kɛ anuŋ amene ba; ne ŋlɔk ba shur ne zizik. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Fe iki yiŋɛ nena te kǝr tabǝ shur ayi ne na iki mimin, ir keŋ ndi ne na. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kǝr izhin bǝ zǝ arik waŋ ndi ba vli ba, ndi anuŋ ne na; ndi ne cɛr: &lt;&lt;Aneshir ne zǝ sɔŋ te bɛ li te sɔ te lu te glu ndi abǝ yaŋ zhi Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Kǝr ta bɛ zǝ amba, ir kǝŋ ndi anuŋ nɛ na, te aneshir amkplik 23,000 nɛ ku ber zhiin. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kǝr ta bǝ ten Ŋgɔŋ ba, ndi anuŋ nɛ na, te anǝwa ne fa ba te duŋ ba ku. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kǝr ta bǝ lɛ mumur ir keŋ ndi anuŋ ne na, te ine shar ayou Arik ne ŋlɔk ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Iki yiŋɛ ne na bǝn abeba tǝ abe yi ta iki tsar nena cɛrǝ tǝ be gbaŋ ta atɔŋ, ta kusɔŋ nǝ mkpaŋ ndi iklɛtu yi goŋmimi nǝ nye. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Neme, waŋ ndi ate yik te di wa aklikla mgbamgbaŋ, bɛ tǝ zee kǝr bɛ lu zhaku ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Kɔtǝ iten tayi ndi izhin yigǝ ai ir kǝŋ ndi inye aneshir. Ama Arik anyak ikpa nyak maa, neme ba tei duŋ aten zhin inaŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ min ba; nǝ mkpaŋ ndi ate ten zhin, atei nǝk zhin ikli gbamgbaŋ tǝ vuŋ kpa, tena naa zhin ankɔŋ anǝ li ru.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Neme, akpaamuŋ, kǝr zhin bɛ zǝ arik ne yaŋ vli ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Mǝ lɛ bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi mgbemgbeb aner; izhin bǝ tɔ akpa min ambuk nǝ iki yiŋ ndi M mblai. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Ba ayi kuca keŋ ndi ta gli kǝ nǝ li kili yi Ŋgɔŋ tǝna gbar Arik: ndi ta tǝ sɔmɔ nekǝ, gab kǝ ta nyɛr ne azhizhi Kristi. Bǝn borodi keŋ ndi ta gab kǝ, tǝ ta kǝ, ta gab kǝ nǝ kpa kɛ Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Fe borodi zhiin, taba, abaŋ ndi ta klɛ tetɛk, tayi kpa zhiin, ta gab borodi zhiin. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Tɔ zhin aneshir abǝ Isrela; abaŋ ndi ata ituk amkpur agab nǝ begedi kǝ naa Arik ndum. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Ka me ndi ibaŋ yiŋ ndi anǝk arik ne yaŋ vli ayi kinuŋǝ? ka arik ane yaŋ vli ayi kinuŋ ni? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ɔɔ! Iki yiŋ ndi M mblai ma tǝ aye nii ituk amkpur nǝ begedi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik atsik anerim ibaŋ, ba nǝk Arik ba, bam nǝ nta nyɛmɛ te izhin bǝ biŋ atu bǝn anerim ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ba zhin tei sɔ nǝ kuca kɛ Ŋgɔŋ tǝ na sɔ nǝ kuca kɛ anerim ba; ba zhin tei li ikili yi Arik te na li ikili yi anerim ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ka wɔb Ŋgɔŋ ne kla te abe tǝ mfui? Tǝ ta klik naŋui?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabǝ na kɔte nii te duŋ Arik abɛ ta ŋgɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Anuŋ adi,&lt;&lt;kɔte anii irɛ&gt;&gt; ama ba kɔte anii yi didik ba. &lt;&lt;kɔte anii irɛ &gt;&gt; ama ba kɔte anii irɛ ne kpa kɛ neshir ba. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Kǝr nuŋ abɛ wɔb na itu maa iki didik ba, ama abɛ na izumen iki didik. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Izhin bǝ ta kɔte nii ndi alɛbǝ nǝ dub kǝ leb nna, nǝ iyaŋ rib tɔ nǝ lɛ kǝ idur min. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Tǝ, ndi cɛr nǝ di, &lt;&lt;Igɔŋmimi bǝn kɔte nii ndi iyi nǝ miŋe iyi kǝ Ŋgɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ate yi ndi ine yaŋ zǝ Arik ate zhɔu li kili te te yi ndi utei gar, idurubǝ li kɔte nii ndi ne nyak ne angus ami yaŋ rib ne lɛ kɛ yi nǝ idur mi. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ adi zhin, &lt;&lt;Ikili yiŋɛ nɛ sur arik anǝ yaŋ vli neyi,&gt;&gt;fena kǝr zhin bɛ li ikili me ba, ne yik shak ayi iwaŋ ndi ne blau ma bǝn lɛ kɛ idur. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />fena, ba nǝ idur mi ba, ama nǝ idur iyi nere. &lt;&lt;Ame, fe,&gt;&gt; inuŋ arib, &lt;&lt;tǝ anii iduŋ izuk zhɔk muŋ nǝ na ki igblik idur yi nuŋ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ate yi ndi M nǝ nyɛr Arik nǝ iki yi li muŋ, tǝ aye nii duŋ anab me vǝnŋɔk nɛ atu ayi ikili yiŋ ndi M ne nyɛr Arik neyi me? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ne me kɔte iki yiŋ ndi utei lii kɔ utei sɔi ka ayi ki yiŋ ndi utei nai, ubǝ nai te duŋ Arik abɛ ta ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Kǝr ijin bǝ duŋ inuŋ azhaku ba, ka ai awɔ ne Yahudawa, ka ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, ka ayi abǝ zǝ Arik, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />ir keŋ ndi me wɔb te bɛ na kɔte ŋɔwa iki didik ne kɔte ankɔŋ atawa. Bam wɔb te bɛ yik iki didik muŋ ba ama me wɔb te kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ yik iki didik, te bɛ ta ba zhɔk.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Izhin bǝ na ki yiŋ ndi me na ir keŋ ndi mzi iki na Kristi.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amba abɛ kpa atu amen aku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Mǝ mgbar zhin te zhin shum zhi ne kɔ te ankɔŋ atawa, te na vuŋ kiki yiŋ ndi me ne mbla zhin te na gli gbamgbaŋ, te na gli itsar ir keŋ ndi M nǝ mbla zhin neyi.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ankyak me wɔb te zhin bǝ zhi tǝ, Kristi ayou kɔ te lulum tawa ayi Yesɔ, ŋgɔŋ ayou kɔ te iwa tawa ayi lu maa ŋgɔŋ ayi Yesɔ wa ana yi Arik. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Fe lulum waŋ ndi aben ka atɔ ti nǝ lɛ kǝ Arik nǝ du aneshir te ku tu maa ne la lɛ ben Arik ba nɛ tɔ Arik ashak yi ba. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Iwa waŋ ndi ate ben ka abla lɛ ke Arik nǝ du aneshir te yaŋ ku tu maa ne nǝk lumaa ishisha; banǝ yi kaaŋkaŋ bǝn iwa nǝ vu amkpalaŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />A te yi ndi iwa ne kyak kpa tu maa, abɛ kɔn fumfuk tu maa, ate yi ndi ayi ki shisha te abɛ kɔn tu maa, te abɛ kpa kɛ aku. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Lulum bai ku tu maa ba, tǝ wa ayi kam bǝn gbar iye Arik. Ama iwa ayi kam gbar yi lulum. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ne kuti lulum ba rɛ kpa kɛ iwa ba, iwa arɛ kpa kɛ lulum <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />ba ne na lulum netu akɛ iwa ba, ne na iwa netu akɛ lulum <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Nǝ ŋa kǝ abǝ shar ayou Arik, fe, nǝ rɛ tǝ iwa abe ku tu maa tɛ tsar duŋ azhi tǝ wa ayi nɛ angus bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ lumaa.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ne me, ne ankɔŋ ayou Ŋgɔŋ, iwa ba ne gab akpa ben lulum ba, ayi amɛ lulum bane gab akpa ben iwa ba. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Ir keŋ ndi iwa arɛ ben lulum, lulum ayi ŋli kɛ iwa, ikiki bɔbɔk irɛ ben Arik. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Zib zhin akpa min kai anenen tǝ iwa abe ben Arik nǝ miŋ du aneshir nǝ yaŋ ku tu maa. Nǝ rɛ te iwa abɛ ku ayi te ben Arik iyaŋ kpa tu maa kui? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ashe bane bla kai, ilulum abɛ luk tu bai ki yi shisha kai, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Fena ne atu ayi wama ayi ki yi kɔk atɔ. Fumfuk tu maa nɛ nǝgu tǝ abe ku tu maa. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ate yi ndi nuŋ a tei te atam, tɔ taba ba ta ne na zhi kinuŋ ne akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik na gar kam amɛ ba.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iki li yi Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Nǝ tu yi lɛ kɛ kpa nyak kɛ nyɛ bam tei mgbar zhin ba, bin atu min ba yi na ki didik ba, ayi na ki mimin. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Tǝ ne ku ti ndi zhin ne bine, yi Akabaŋkɔŋ, me wɔ izhin ne ŋar akpa min me yiŋ ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ me. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Nǝ rɛ iga aŋa abɛ yi ne min miŋ, tǝ abɛ zhi abaŋ ndi atei ta nyɛmɛ bǝn abɛba nǝ miŋ mine. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Atei yi ndi izhin ne bin sɔŋ amkpa zhin ba yi iki li yi Arik izhin zen li kai, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ayi amkpa ane li kili awaŋa, kɔte ŋɔwa a su tu ne agbǝgba maa. anuŋ asɔŋ ne kasa, anuŋ azǝn so te te ahwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ba zhin yine akɔb ayiŋ ndi zhin tei sɔŋ te li te so kai, watɔ, ba zhin ne tɔ abɛ zi Arik shak ayi kai? ka zhin wɔb te zhin bǝ mlak abaŋ ndi ba ayi ne kili kai? Me te di zhin kikinei? Me gbar zhin ne ki yi na mine? Mm, bam te gbar zhin ba!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ki yiŋɛ ndi mǝne tayi ben Arik, ai yi me te nek zhin: Ndi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ, ne buu yiŋɛ ne nugu ne aŋɔk ayi Yahudawa, ne baŋ kili, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />Ndi ne nyɛr Arik, Mǝ mlik kili me, tedi &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi kpa muŋ, kɛŋ ndi yi ne tu min izhin bɛ na amɛ te ben shuzhi zhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Ndi ne nek ba ikili yi Arik, ne baŋ kuca ma, tedi, &lt;&lt;Vǝn kuca yiŋɛ yi kpa nyak yayas, ndi ne bla zhin tedi waŋa ayi azhizhi amuŋ, izhin bǝ na me ne kpaŋ keŋ ndi tei so, te ben shum zhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ne me, ikpa keŋ ndi zhin zin li kili, te na so ne vǝn kuca yiŋɛ izhin shu iku kǝ Ŋgɔŋ, kɔmɔ ne mkpaŋ kɛ kam ŋur kam maa.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ne me, waŋ ndi a te li kili Arik kɔte so ne vǝn kuca yi Arik ne ankɔŋɔ ne yaŋ rɛ, ne la lɛ te na sak kpa Ŋgɔŋ bǝn azhizhi amaa iya. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ tsar tu maa tɔ, te she ta borodi tena so ne vǝn kuca ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Te yi ndi nuŋ bate zhi ki yi di ikpa kǝ Ŋgɔŋ ndi ate ta te na sɔ ne nkɔŋ kɛ yaŋ rɛ bǝn ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi ba ayou Arik ba, ne zhɔk tu maa ne min kɛ ambuk ndi ate ta tena sɔ ne vǝn kuca yiŋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Waŋa ai ki yiŋ ndi anuŋ tetɛk ne miŋ mine ayi ne lɔ ben yaŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ, anuŋ tetɛk ne ku. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Ate yi ndi ta zib akpa mɔr baliŋ, ba tai nyɛ nɛ angus akɛ tǝ ambuk iye Arik ba. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Fe nɛ tǝǝ ta ambuk te nǝkta iya nǝ Ŋgɔŋ, tǝ duŋ kǝr abɛ tǝ ta ambuk bǝn aner abɛ gɔŋmimi ba.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Ne me, izhineba amunya, ate yi ndi zhin biŋ te tei li kili, izhin bǝ ŋub akpa min. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Iwaŋ ndi ikasa tǝ tǝu, abɛ li kili nǝ kɔb, te kǝr mkpaŋ keŋ ndi izhin te nyɛ biŋ kǝr inuŋ abɛ gbur iya ku zhin ne ba, ne tu yi kiki nuŋ, amɛ ikiki nuŋ se mkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi Mne nyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Inǝk yi zhi Izhu Tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Fe ne atu ayi nek izhi Izhu Tsetser, amunya, bam ta nyɛmɛ te izhin bǝ sɔŋ awa ba. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Izhin nǝ zhi mkpaŋ ndi izhin banǝ zen zǝ Arik ba, ne lɔm zhin tɛ duŋ zhin zǝ arik anǝ yaŋ vli bǝn yaŋ lɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Fe mbla zhin te ndi ba nuŋ ayime waŋ ndi Izhu Tsetser ayou Arik ayi ben abɔu te di, &lt;&lt;ne te Yesɔ anu amimin ba,&gt;&gt; neme inuŋ ba tei di, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ ayi Ŋgɔŋ,&gt;&gt; anaga yi iwaŋ ndi Izhu Tsetser ayi ben abɔu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Inǝk izhi iyime kaŋkaŋ, ama Izhu Tsetser iyi zhin. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ŋkuŋkɔŋ yi zǝ Arik iyi tetɛk ama Ŋgɔŋ ayi zhin. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ŋkuŋkɔŋ yi na ndum iyi tetɛk, ama ai Arik zhin wa aduŋ kɔte ŋɔwa na ndum.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Tǝ kɔte ŋɔwa ne nǝgu izhi iyi Izhu Tsetser te bɛ duŋ kɔte ŋɔwa aflu ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ne nek inuŋ izhi Mgbemgbeb irɛ bǝn Izhu Tsetser, inuŋ izhi kiki tetɛk ndi irɛ bǝn Izhu izhiin iyiŋɛ inǝk ishak izhi. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Izhiin bǝn izhu tsetser yiŋɛ inǝk neshir nuŋ itanyɛmɛ, fena neshir nuŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ duŋ are. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />inuŋ ina ikiki yi vuŋ anu, inuŋ izhi yi du lɛ kǝ Arik, inuŋ izhi Izhu ye Arik bǝn ishetan, inuŋ nɛ nǝgu izhi izhu kaŋkaŋ, inuŋ ne nǝgu izhi bla aŋa kaŋkaŋ. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Bɔbɔk izhi iyiŋɛ ai ndum kɛ Izhu Tsetser izhiin iyiŋɛ ndi ana kime bɔbɔk; ndi nǝ tiu, tɛ nǝk kɔtǝ ŋɔwa kiki kaaŋkaŋ.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpa zhin yi ne igab tetɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ikpa iyi zhin, te yi ne igab tetɛk, ndi igab iyi tetɛk ama ikpa iyi izhin, amɛ Almasihu ayi zhin. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Fena ane su ta ne amashir ne Izhu Tsetser zhiin te ta bǝ yi ikpa zhin, kɔta bǝ yi Yahudawa kɔ ba ta yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, agɛn kɔ ba agɛn ba, bɔbɔk mɔrɔ ne nek ta Izhu izhin.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Amɛ ikpa ba yi gab zhin ba iyi igab tetɛk. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Te yi ndi iza idi, &lt;&lt;nga bam yi ŋɔk ba, nga bam yi ne min kɛ kpa ba,&gt;&gt;ibla amɛ ba tei duŋ kɛ yaŋ yi igab yi kpa ba. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Te yi ndi itɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;nga bam yi iyi ba, nga bam yi gab yi kpa ba,&gt;&gt; ibla me ba tei yar yi igab yi kpa ba. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Abɛ di ikpa bɔbɔk yi iyi, atei wɔ lɛ ne ni? Tena yi ndi bɔbɔk ikpa ai itɔŋ, atei baŋ mgbɔ ne ni? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Neme Arik ne na igab yi kpa, kɔte tayi, ne nai ir keŋ ndi ne teu. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Abɛdi ikpa ai igab zhiin, nki gab yi kpama ibǝ yi amei? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Nǝ yi amɛ, igab iyi tetɛk, ama ikpa iyi zhin.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Iyi ba tei di iŋɔk, &lt;&lt;bam wɔ bu ba!&gt;&gt; Itu ba tei di aza,&lt;&lt;bam wɔb bu ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ba yiŋɛ ankyak ba, igab kpa yiŋ ndi ayige bai iki nuŋ ba, iyi yi anenen, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />igab yi kpa yiŋ ndi ayige te di ba rɛ ndi nki me ba ai yi anǝge ŋgɔŋ. Neme igab yi kpa mɔr yiŋ ndi ba rɛ tɔ ba, ai yi aŋubǝ ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Igab mɔr yiŋ ndi ire tɔ ba nai ikinuŋ ba. Ama Arik ne biŋ igab yi kpa te nek ŋgɔŋ ne igab yiŋ ndi ayige bai ikinuŋ ba, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />te kǝr yaŋ biŋ atu bɛ yi ne kpa ba, ama igab bǝ ŋub akpa men ankun azhiin. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Te yi ndi igab zhin te yik iyah igaba bɛ yik iyah bɔbɔk mǝne; te yi ndi te gbar nuŋ asak, abɛ nyɛr bɔbɔk mǝne.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Amɛ izhin yi ndi ikpa kǝ Kristi, kɔte ŋɔwa ayi igab yi kpa maa. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Nǝ miŋ ke abǝ zǝ Arik nɛ hria anuŋ abɛ yi abǝ du lɛ maa, anuŋ abɛ yi abǝ bla shar maa, tɛ anuŋ bɛ yi abǝ tsar lɛ maa, anuŋ abɛ yi abɛ na iki vuŋ anu, fe anuŋ nɛ nǝk ba mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ duŋ abɛ lɔ are, anuŋ abɛ lɔk aneshire, anuŋ abɛ ŋub abɛ zǝ Yesɔ, anuŋ abɛ zhi lɛ aŋa kaŋkaŋ. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Ba bɔbɔk aneshir ayi abɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik ba, ba bɔbɔk aneshir ayi abɛ bla shar yi Arik ba, kɔ bɔbɔk aneshir abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik ba, kɔ bɔbɔk aneshir abɛ na iki vuŋ anu ba <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />ka duŋ aneshir are nǝ lɔ men ka abe lɛ nɛ aŋa ka abɛ bla iki yiŋ ndi ilɛme di. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Naa asusun amin, nǝ kiki didik iyi nǝk. Ididik ŋgɔŋgɔŋ bɔbɔk, ndi ame, ai ki iyi kuzǝ yiŋɛ.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Inyɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Kɔ ate yi ndi Mte lɛ ne aŋa ayi neshir, bǝn aŋa abɛ shar ayou Arik, ate yi ndi bam yi nǝ nyɛr ba, me yi ndi asha kɔ mgblɔ kɛ glɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />kɔ te yi ndi mte mbla kiki yi nyɛ ne tii, te na zhi kiki yi suyir ben zhi, kɔ mna yi ne tanyɛmɛ ndi mtai tun mkpaŋ, mba mte yi ne nyɛr ba, neme bam yi ki nuŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />kɔ ate yi ndi M tei nek adudunki amuŋ, te na nek kpa muŋ te abɛ goŋ kɛ, a te yi ndi bam nyɛr aneshir ba, ba ne nǝm kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Inyɛr ivuŋ susun te na ki didik, inyɛr ba te wub ba, ba ŋur asa ba, ba lɛk tu ba. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Inyɛr ba yaŋ atɔŋ ba, ba duŋ neshir anyɛr tu maa teduŋ nuŋ ba, ba te mfu andanda ba, ba cɛr lalɛ nyak ba, ba Gli neshir ne susun ba <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Inyɛr ba tanyɛme ne zumimin ba, itanyɛmɛ nǝ na didik <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Nyɛr vuŋ susun nǝ kiki bɔbɔk, ina ta nyɛmɛ ne kiki bɔbɔk, ina zhɔk susun ne kiki bɔbɔk, ina vuŋ kpa gli ne kiki bɔbɔk.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Inyɛr ba yine klɛ tu ba. Ibla kiki yi ti itei klɛ tu, aŋa atei klɛ tu, ikiki yiŋɛ itei gayir. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Izhi mɔr bane shaga ba, bla kiki yi nyɛ bane shaga ba. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ndi shaga ite nyɛ, fe yaŋ shaga itei naŋ dɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ndi Mnǝ yi vǝvǝn, ilɛ muŋ, iwɔ muŋ, ilɛ susun muŋ bɔbɔk inǝ yi kǝ muǝn; azǝzaŋa ndi M yi vǝnenzak, bam nak ri lɛ nǝ kuŋkɔŋ iyi muen ba. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Azǝzaŋa ta tɔ zenzen ne malibi; fe ta tei yik ayi ben ayi. Azizaŋa Myik ne shushu; ne bɛr yuŋɔ ta tei zhi kiki tetɛk, ir keŋ ndi ne zhi ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Fe, azǝzaŋa nǝ ki mɛ tar yiŋɛ nǝ sɔŋ: Itanyɛmɛ, bǝn izhɔk susun, bǝn inyɛr; fe ŋgɔŋɔ amǝne ayi nyɛr.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ilɛ ne aŋa ben kiki yi ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Izhin bɛ vuŋ nyɛr gli, tena wɔb nek yi izhu tsetser, ne bla kiki yi ti. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Iwaŋ ndi a lɛ ne aŋa anuŋ, ba lɛ ben aneshir ba, a lɛ ben Arik, ba inuŋ a zhi kiyiŋ ndi ablai ba, abla kiki yi suyir ne ankɔŋ ayou izhu tsetser <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Fena abaŋ ndi aduu aner ilɛ kɛ Arik te nǝk ba ki, anǝk ba mgbyamgbyaŋ, te nǝk ba sik susun. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Abaŋ ndi alɛ nɛ aŋa anuŋ, azɔk atu amen, ama abaŋ ndi abla du ilɛ kɛ Arik azɔk iflu ye akaba ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Mnǝ wɔb tǝ bɔbɔk min bǝ lɛ nǝ kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ lɛ aŋa kaŋkaŋ ama me wɔb te zhin bǝ bla lɛ kɛ Arik. Iwaŋ ndi abla lɛ kɛ Arik, ne naŋ waŋ ndi alɛ ne aŋa, Nuŋ a te bene bla ki yiŋ ndi lɛ ma.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Neme, amunya, mte nyɛ te lɛ zhin ne aŋa anuŋ, a yi anii zhin tei vuŋ Gli, mba nuŋ a te ben abla zhin ka, kɔ zhi, kɔ bla kiki yi ti, kɔ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Ne lɛ ikiki yi yaŋ vli ir kǝ ayiyaŋ bǝn tǝntaŋ, inuŋ atei na kikin tɛ zhi akɔrɔ mba tɛ ŋurɛ tɛ na vlii ka? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Mba te vli mpluŋ ŋgɔŋ ba, ŋɔwa atei kpa ikpa kɛ tyak ikum? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Iyi amɛ ben abɛ zhin, ate yi ndi zhin lɛ ne aŋa aŋu, ndi ba zhi ki yiŋ ndi zhin blai ba, atei na yi lɛ kɛ yi sha! <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Aŋa ayi kaŋkaŋ ne gɔŋmimi, ba yiŋ ndi ba yi ne ndum ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ate yi ndi bam wɔ iki yiŋ ndi inuŋ ablai ba, myi cen ben ne lɛ me ana yi icen bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Ina yi amɛ bǝn abɛ zhin. Tǝ yi ndi izhin ne wɔb inǝk yi izhu, izhin bɛ vuŋ kpa gli gbamgbaŋ te duŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ abǝ aflu nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Neme iwaŋ ndi ate lɛ aŋa anuŋ abɛ ben Arik te abɛ nǝgu zhi ikiki lɛ maa. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />A te yi ndi mben Arik ne aŋa anuŋ, izhu muŋ iben, ama ilɛ muŋ ba ne na kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Fe M tei na kikin? M tei mben Arik ne izhu muŋ, ama M tei na mben Arik ne susun muŋ, M tei duk asem ayi gbar Arik ne izhu muŋ, M tei na ne lɛ susun muŋ. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Utǝ gbar Arik asak nǝ izhu yi susun mi ankyak, tǝ aner abǝ sha abaŋ ndi ba ayi nǝ miŋ kɛ abǝ yaŋ biŋe adi &lt;&lt;iyɛmɛ&gt;&gt; nǝ iben bǝn inyɛr mi? Banɛ zhi iki yiŋ ndi ublai ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ndi une nyɛr Arik ŋgɔŋ, ama izumin bane vuŋ ne kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Mne nyɛr Arik me lɛ ne aŋa inaŋ zhin bɔbɔk mine. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ne me ne biŋ yi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ ire tem mbla kǝŋ lɛ me ivuŋ iyiŋ ndi yi ne susun muŋ, te me tsar anuŋ ane yi, ne naŋ ndi me lɛ aŋa azhin awur ne aŋa nuŋ.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Izhin ba amunya, izhin bɛ duŋ na ki ndi amumun ba. Ate yi ndi ai zumimin izhin bǝ na ndi asen amumun, ne min asusun zhin bǝ na ki yi anuŋkub. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Nǝ icɛr yi Musa idi, &lt;&lt;Nǝ nkɔŋ ke aneshir lelɛ yayas M tei lɛ bǝn aner amuŋ, Ŋgɔŋ abla. M tei lɛ ne aŋa aye acɛn, neme ma aner amuŋ ba tei wɔm ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Fena, inǝk ilɛ nɛ aŋa ayayas iyi abǝ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ, bai abǝ tanyɛmɛ ba, fe inǝk yi bla kiki yi du ilɛ kǝ Arik iyi kǝ abɛ tanyɛmɛ, bai kǝ abǝ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ne me, ate yi ndi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ atei biŋ atu te zen lɛ ne aŋa anuŋ, abɛ yaŋ zhi ben abɛ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ atei yir te wɔ zhin zen lɛ ne aŋa, ba atei di aner abaŋa ahwa kai? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ama inuŋ ate zǝn du ilɛ ke Arik ndi abǝ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ anuŋ ka aner anuŋ abǝ sha ne nye, atei tanyɛmɛ nǝ la lɛ men ndi ne wɔ. Atei tǝǝ ba ambuk bɔbɔk nǝ ki wɔ menɛ, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />ikiki yi su yir nɛ asusun amen atei glie rumɔ ndende, ankyak atei tar agbarum te zǝkur Arik, abla iklu anyin, &lt;&lt;Ayi zub Arik ayi nǝ miŋ min!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ na kɔte ni ne ankɔŋ adidik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ta tei na di kikin, amunya? mkpaŋ keŋ ndi zhin tǝ biŋ, inuŋ abɛ duk asem ayi gbar Arik, inuŋ abena tsar ilɛ kɛ Arik, inuŋ abe bla, inuŋ abɛ lɛ ne aŋa, inuŋ abɛ gbu kɛ aŋa, abe na ki mɛ anenen. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />A te yi ndi inuŋ atei lɛ ne aŋa anuŋ abɛ duŋ kam aya ba, ate yi tetɛk abɛ yi atar, abɛ lɛ a zhizhin, inuŋ abɛ ben kam ilɛ mɛ asen te bɛ zhi kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ama ate yi ndi inuŋ nǝ bla lɛme ŋara ba yime amwɔ ba, fe iwaŋ ndi nɛ le nɛ acɛn aŋama abe ku anu tɛ le nǝ tu maa bǝn Arik.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Aner ayaa ka atar abaŋ ndi ne nǝk ba du lɛ kǝ Arik abe lɛ, fe nkime abe tsar ki yi bla menɛ atɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ate yi ndi ilɛ kɛ iki yi ti ne nyɛ nuŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ, ine kuti ilɛmɛ abɛ ku anu. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Bɔbɔk mine izhin tei zhi du ilɛ ke Arik azhizhiin, te kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ vuŋ tsar te na yi ne susun kɛ kli gbamgbaŋ. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Inǝk yi du ilɛ ke Arik inǝ lɛme abe gli kǝ anenen, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />tǝ Arik banɛ ta nyɛmɛ tǝ ta bǝ yi aneshir abǝ kpur akpa ba ama ta bǝ yi adidik bǝn sɔŋ kǝ sik. Ndi bǝn bɔbɔk aner abɛ zǝ Arik, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />amba abɛ ku anu ndi abɛ zǝ Arik ate biŋ. Tǝ bɛ na nek ba mkpaŋ kɛ lɛ ba, ama abɛ zǝ ir keŋ ndi ne bla ne cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ate yi ndi awɔb te aba abɛ zhi kinuŋ, abɛ rib alulum amen ne kɔb, ayi ki shisha te amba abɛ lɛ ne miŋ kɛ biŋ abɛ zǝ Arik.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ayi ne atu min ilɛ kɛ Arik ne kuti kɔ ilɛ kɛ Arik ne nyɛ ben zhine ba kiki min aner abɛ kɔrɔntiya ini? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ ayik tǝ iwa ayi nǝ shar ayou Arik kɔ wa ayi nǝ inǝk iyi izhu tsetser, abɛ zhi tɛ di iki yiŋ ndi mblai ma irɛ ben Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Inuŋ ate kyak kam tɔ kiyiŋ ndi mblau ma iwa ma ba tei na kam atɔu ba.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ne me, akpa amuŋ, izhin bǝ nek atu amin ne ndum kɛ zhi kiki yi kuti, izhin bǝ duŋ yara ne lɛ aŋa anuŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ankyak izhin bǝ na kɔte ni ne ankɔŋ adidik te na nai anenen.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Ilu Yesɔ ne bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Azizaŋa, akpa amuŋ, mdi izhin bǝ shuzhi ne ilɛ kɛ men keŋ ndi mne mbla zhin, keŋ ndi zhin ne takɛ, te na zǝ kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Nǝ lɛ kɛ men kɛŋ ndi ane zuk zhin zhɔk, zhin te gli lɛ keŋ ndi mne mbla zhin gbamgbaŋ, ate yiŋ ndi zhin ba nǝ ta kɛ ne shushu ba.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Tǝ ilɛ keŋ ndi mnǝ du zhin ane kǝ nǝ kuti rɛ: Kristi ne ku ne na zumimin mɔr, ir keŋ ndi ne cɛr nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />te ne ru Yesɔ, te iku bane gliu ba ane lu ne kumɔ ne bɛr yi ntar ndi ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />ne na ru klɛ Biturus, bǝn nki amɛ wur ane yaa ma <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ankyak, te na ru aklii aner abǝ kam amkplik atuŋ ne mkpaŋ zhiin, nki mǝne ayime har azizaŋa, ama nki mǝne ne ka ku <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ankyak ne na munoru Yakubu tu maa, te na tsar tu maa ben abǝ zeu na ndum, <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />ne klɛtu bɔbɔk,Yesɔ ne ru akliim nga waŋ ndi bam nǝ mla tem na ndum maa ba.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Fe ngam yi nǝ klɛtu nǝ min kɛ abǝ zeu na ndum maa, bam nǝ mla tǝ abɛ zhɔm tǝ nǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik, ir keŋ ndi mnǝ sak abǝ na ndum Arik iya. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ama ne na didik ye Arik, mne yi ir keŋ ndi m yime azizaŋa, ina didik yiŋ ndi ne nam bane kɔmɔ sha ba, mne na ndum naŋ kɔte ŋɔwa ne miŋ mine, bai nga ba, ai na didik yi Arik ndi iyi ne susun muŋ <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ka ai nga, kai abɛba, ta du lɛ kɛ Arik, ne me izhin ne na tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ maa.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilu aneshir ne bɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Ama te yi ndi a du lɛ kɛ Kristi te di ne lǝgu ne bɛ, te anii duŋ anuŋ atun tedi ba yeme kai? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />A te yiŋ ndi ilu nǝ bɛ ba yime ba, ashe bane lǝk Kristi nǝ bɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Ate yi ndi Kristi banɛ lu nǝ bɛ ba, idu lɛ kɛ Arik iyi ki sha, itanyɛmɛ min iyi sha <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Ndi yeme, ta nǝ timu nǝ sak kɛ Arik, te tanǝ tanyɛmɛ bɛn Arik, tǝ di nɛ lǝk Kristi nǝ bɛ, iwaŋ ndi ba te lǝgu ba, itei yi ndi bata ne tanyɛme ne lu maa ba, fe abaŋ ndi neka ku ba tei lu ba imenyi. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ate yi ndi abaŋ ndi ne ku ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Arik bate lu ba, fe Kristi bane lu ne bɛ ba maa yi. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Ate yi ndi bane lǝk Kristi ne bɛ ba itanyɛmɛ mɔr yi sha, ta nak rǝ yi abɛ lalɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Fena itǝ yi amɛ abaŋ ndi nɛ ka ku bǝn Kristi ne ka ku adɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ate yii ndi izhɔk susun mɔr nǝ min kǝ Kristi ire nǝ ivli kǝŋe ankyak ba naŋ amɛ ba, fena tei bǝ yi abǝ wɔ ilɔ susun inaŋ kɔtǝ ŋɔ bɔbɔk nǝ gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Mbla zhin te ne lǝk Kristi ne bɛ, a yi wa a yi vǝn mla yi abaŋ ndi neka kurna. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Iku ne rɛ bǝn ineshir zhiin, ina yi ne tu yi neshir zhiin ilu nǝ bɛ na yime. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ir keŋ ndi iku ne nyɛ ne atu ayi Ademu, neme ne atu yi Kristi aneshir abɛ zeu bɔbɔk atei lu. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ama kɔte ŋɔwa ne kpaŋ maa: Kristi wa te ku ti, ankyak ne bɛr yi ŋur kam ma, abaŋ ndi ayi abɛ Yesɔ atei lu ne bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Fe iklɛtu tei nyɛ; Kristi atei naŋ angɔŋgɔŋ abǝ yi tsetser, mgbyamgbyaŋ, bǝn klik, tɛ baŋ kɔb asak Arik Tetɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Atei gli ŋgɔŋ maa te caŋ abɛ kyagu yi ne aza. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Inǝ tǝ zɔr waŋ ndi a tei baŋu agli atibe ai kuh. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />&lt;&lt;Arik ne nek kɔte anii ne aŋɔk amaa.&gt;&gt; Neme ndi ne di &lt;&lt;Ne nek kɔte nii&gt;&gt; ne ŋɔk amaa, iyi ndende ba te vuŋ Arik ne tu maa ba, iwaŋ ndi ne nek Kristi kiki bɔbɔk. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Fe ndi ne nek kɔte ni ne aŋɔk kɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ maa, ankyak Izu Arik ne tu maa atei baŋ tu maa nek waŋ ndi ne nǝgu kɔte ni me, te Arik abɛ yi kɔte nii.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ntǝ yi ndi ilu nǝ bɛ ba yime ba, te anii duŋ asu anuŋ ne atu abɛ ku? Ntǝ yi ndi abɛ ku ba tei lu ba, te anii duŋ asu anuŋ ne atu abɛ ku? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Tǝ anii duŋ ta yi ne miŋ kɛ yik iyah kɔte kpaŋ takɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Akpa amuŋ, ai zhine ba duŋ me nga ne atu ayi Kristi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr, kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ me na nek tu muŋ ndi M tei nku nɛ atu min. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />A te yi ndi myi ne susun kɛ tsik mgbu ben aner angɔŋgɔŋ ne Afisa, ne yik iyi neshir ankyak, te aye nii iyi idǝk muŋ? Te yi ndi abɛ ku batei lu ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">&lt;&lt;Duŋ ta bǝ li te so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">Te amblɛ ta te ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Kǝr zhin bɛ duŋ alɔm zhin ba: &lt;&lt;Isɔŋ ben aner amimin, icɔk asusun adidik ila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Izhin bǝ kam gli asusun amin nyaga anenen, te na kiki didik, te duŋ na zhin zumimin,te anuŋ bane zhi Arik ba, me bla amɛ te shisha bǝ te zhin.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilu yi kpa iyime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Inuŋ atei rib, &lt;&lt;Abɛ kumɔ atei lu kiki ne? Atei kama anyak nǝ kpa takɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Iwa ner bliblik! Kiyiŋ ndi unǝ tibǝ, bai tɔ ba, itei bɔ baliŋ te shi tɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Iki yiŋ ndi une tibɛ, bǝbǝ ki yiŋ ndi une tibɛ bai yi utei sɛrǝ ba, itei yi mgbyaŋ ankyak, ka atei yi alikama, ka tei yi bǝbǝ kinuŋ, bai mkpuŋ kpa kǝ kime iyi tei tɔ ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ne me Arik wa anǝk kɛ kpa ndi ne teu, ben kɔte bǝbǝ ki takɛ ai nek kɛ kpa maa. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ba bɔbɔk mǝne ayi ne na ir zhiin ba: aneshir ayi ne kpa men kaŋkaŋ, inarum ayi ne kpa men kaŋkaŋ, aŋliŋlɔ ana yi ne kpa men, ambɛ ana yi ne kpa men. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Nǝ na Arik ikpa kɛ shu iyime ikpa kɛ gɔŋmimi na yime, ama bɔbɔk mǝne ikpa kɛ shu iyi kaaŋkaŋ bǝn ikpa kǝ gɔŋmimi na yi kaaŋkaŋ <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Ilaŋ yi arik iyi nǝ re maa, iyi hwa nayi nǝ re maa, bǝn cinces ire kaaŋkaŋ; ko nǝ min kǝ ncincese ire mǝne yi kaaŋkaŋ.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ina yi amɛ ne abɛ kam lu ne ku kǝ bɛ. ikpa keŋ ndi ne ru kɛ iyi kɛ bɔ, neme atei lǝk kɛ ne kpa kɛ yaŋ bɔ; <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ndi te ru kǝ, iyi mimiŋ bǝn iyaŋ klik; atɛ lǝk kǝ, itei re tǝna klik. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ate ru kǝ, itei yi kpa kɛ ku, tɛ lǝk kǝ nǝ kpa kǝ yaŋ ku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Tǝ yi ndi ikpa kɛ ku iyime, ikpa kǝ yaŋ ku na yime. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Ne cɛr amɛ, &lt;&lt;Iner ne ku ti, ndi ayi Ademu, ne yi neshir ne vli&gt;&gt; Ademu mɔ ne yi izhu tsetser yi vli. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ama bai kpa kǝ tsetser kǝ tei kuti nyɛ ba, ayi kpa kɛ bɔ, neme kpa kɛ yaŋ ku itei nyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Neshir ne kuti, Ademu, ne rɛ gɔŋmimi, Neshir ne yaa ndi ayi Yesɔ ne rɛ gbarshu. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ndi ner ne rɛ mimi, ne me ndi abaŋ ndi are mimi, ir keŋ ndi ne shu ayime, Iyi amɛ ndi abɛ shu ayime. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Ndi ne na ŋli ta ne ri kpa yi neshir ne rɛ mimi, neme ta tei baŋ ri kpa kɛ ner ni rɛ shu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Mna bla zhin akpa amuŋ, ikpa kɛ yi ne azhizhi ba tei yir kɔb Arik ba, ina yi amɛ ikɛ bɔ ba tei baŋ kɛ yaŋ bɔ ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Wɔ zhin, M tei mbla zhin kinuŋ yi kuŋkum! bai bɔbɔk mɔr ta tei ku ba, ama ai bɔbɔk mɔr ikpa mɔr tei kam sen <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mkpaŋ zhin ndi tsik ngui, ne vli mpluŋ kɛ klɛ tu. Atei wɔ ivli mpluŋ, abɛ ku atei lu ne kpa kɛ yaŋ bɔ, atei kam akpa mɔr asen. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Atei baŋ kpa kɛ yaŋ bɔ aku kɛ bɔ, ikɛ yaŋ ku aku kɛ ku. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ndi te baŋ kpa kɛ yaŋ ku aku kɛ ku, te na baŋ kɛ yaŋ bɔ aku kɛ bɔ, Fe lɛ keŋ ndi ne cɛr kɛ ma itei shaga: &lt;&lt;Ne mli ku adɔmɔ. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;&lt;Iwa iku, li ikum mi iyi neme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Iwa iku mgbyamgbyaŋ mi yi ne me?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ku iyi la lɛ, mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ la lɛ ayi cɛr iyi Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Fe tabǝ nyɛr Arik! ndi ne nek ta li ru ne tu ayi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Almasihu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Ne me, izhin akpa amuŋ, klɛ zhin mgbamgbaŋ. Kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ kinuŋ baŋ asusun amin ba. Izhin bǝ nek atu amin ŋgɔŋ ne ndum kɛ Arik, te izhin ne zhi te iyah min ne ndum kɛ Arik ba yi isha ba.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Biŋ kiki yi nek aner abɛ na ndum Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Azizaŋa nǝ lɛ kǝ biŋ kiki iyi nǝk aner abɛ zǝ Arik: Na zhin ir keŋ ndi mne mbla abɛ zǝ Arik ne Galantiya abɛ na. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />kɔ te bɛr yi sɔŋ sik tayi kɔ te ŋɔwa abɛ men anyak azɔb ne miŋ kɛ iki yiŋ ndi ayik, izhin bǝ men kpa kɛ nyak ndi mte nyɛ ba atei na tuŋ kinuŋ abiŋ ba. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ndi mte nyɛ, fe M tei nǝk mplimplɛ iyi cɛr tǝ tsar abaŋ ndi izhin nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛba tǝ vu zhin kiki me tǝ nǝk nǝ Urshelima. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Itei rɛ tem zǝ ba muŋ yi, atei kum goŋ.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne wɔb te wa bǝ gar kɔrɔntiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Mǝ kam nyɛ ben abɛ zhi, ndi mte tsǝn tuntun yi Makidɔniya klɛ, M tei zǝ Makidɔniyi. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Ayi ndi M tei baŋ mkpaŋ ben abɛ zhin, kɔ mklɛ kus ben abɛ zhin, te zhin bǝ kum goŋ ndi mte gar kɔte me. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Bam wɔb tem yik zhin azizaŋa te ngar gayir sha ba; m zhɔk susun tǝm baŋ mkpaŋ ben abɛ zhin, ndi Ŋgɔŋ a te tanyɛme. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ama M tei sɔŋ ne Afisa mla ne bɛr gyaŋ yi Pɛntekɔs, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />tǝm yik alǝla angɔŋ ane na ndum ne bum, te aner abɛ te zor bene bɛm ayi tetɛk.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Ate yi ndi Timoti te nyɛ, kǝr abɛ yik ki yiŋ ndi itei nugu sǝsǝk ne miŋ min ba, ne min kɛ na ndum kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ndi myi amɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Kǝr nuŋ ne miŋ min abɛ kyak tɔu shak ayi ba, ama izhin bǝ zɔgu ma nǝ tsǝn nǝ sik, tǝ abɛ ka ŋur akam anyak bǝn abɛm; tǝ M zǝn ŋub kam nyak maa ndɔ bǝn amunya.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Azǝzaŋa, nɛ tu ayi zumɔr Apolɔ. Mkpaŋ nuŋ M nǝgu lɛ tǝ abɛ gar bǝn abɛzhin bǝn nki amunya, ama banɛ nyak susun kɛ gara azizaŋa ba. Ate yik mkpaŋ, fɛna, ai ka gar.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Izhin bǝ hria ayi; te klɛ zhin mgbamgbaŋ ne tanyɛmɛ nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik; izhin bǝ yi aner abɛ klik asusun; tsǝ kli zhin. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Iki yiŋ ndi izhin tei nai, izhin bǝ nai ne nyɛr akpa.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Izhin ne zhi te aner abɛ kɔb Stifanu aba ayi abǝ ku ti ta Kristi ne ntun yi Akaya, ne na nǝk atu amen ne nek aner abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik kili, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />izhin bǝ nek ir aner abaŋa atu amin, te ben akpǝkpa kpa mɔr abɛ na ndum ne miŋ kɛ ndum kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Mne nyɛr ndi Stifanu ben Fotuneta bǝn Akaikas ne nyɛ, aba ne na iki yiŋ ndi ba zhin ne yime neyi ba. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ne duŋ kpa muŋ ŋur klik ben zhineba min yi. Izhin bɛ gli ir aner abaŋa anenen.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi Bulus yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Abɛ zǝ Arik ne ntun yi Asiya a tek zhin. Akila ben Bilkisu atǝk zhin ŋgɔŋ ne sak kɛ Arik, ben aneshir abɛ zǝ Arik ndi abiŋ ne kɔb men. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Bɔbɔk amunya ayaŋa atǝk zhin. Izhin bǝ tǝk kɔtǝ ŋɔ nǝ ku asa yi sɔŋ kǝ sik.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nga, Bulus, mcɛr zhin tek yiŋɛ ne ŋɔk muŋ.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Iwaŋ ndi ba te nyɛr Ŋgɔŋ ba, anu amimin abɛ zeu. Arik nyɛ andanda!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Iki didik iyi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ bǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Nyɛr muŋ bǝ gar ben abɛ zhin ne sak kɛ Kristi Yesɔ. Bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>